{"id":"yavno","lemma":"явно","pos":"adv","rank":871,"glosses":["clearly, evidently, obviously","explicitly"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/e/ea/Ru-%D1%8F%D0%B2%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg/Ru-%D1%8F%D0%B2%D0%BD%D0%BE.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Он явно дома.","en":"It is clear that he is at home.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null,{"g":"at home"}]},{"text":"Это явно то, что ты хочешь.","en":"It's obvious that's what you want.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"}]},{"text":"Они явно больше чем просто друзья.","en":"They're definitely more than just friends.","words":[{"g":"they"},null,{"g":"any more"},{"g":"than"},{"g":"simply, plainly, just"},{"g":"close friend","l":"друг"}]},{"text":"Том явно хочет пойти.","en":"Tom clearly wants to go.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},null,{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"to go"}]},{"text":"Это явно твоя вина.","en":"It's obviously your fault.","words":[{"g":"this / it is"},null,{"g":"your","l":"твой"},{"g":"guilt, fault"}]}]}